counterfactuals.output:
A fluorinated elastic copolymer comprising copolymerized units derived from:

1. at least two fluoromonomers selected from tetrafluoroethylene (TFE), hexafluoropropylene (HFP), vinylidene fluoride (VDF), chlorotrifluoroethylene (CTFE), and a perfluoro(alkyl vinyl ether) (PAVE);

2. a diene monomer of formula:

\[
\mathrm{CR_1R_2{=}CR_3{-}R_4{-}CR_5{=}CR_6R_7}
\]

wherein R₁ to R₇ are independently hydrogen, halogen, or a substituted or unsubstituted C₁–C₆ alkyl group, and R₄ is a divalent organic linking group; and

3. ethylene or propylene;

wherein the copolymer is elastomeric and contains a sufficient amount of the diene monomer to provide cure-site functionality or crosslinkable unsaturation.
